message: "If you use or discuss this pattern, please cite it as below."
title: "The Ledger Layer: Making AI-Era Code Auditable"
abstract: >-
  A proposed design pattern in which a Ledger layer drafts a record for every change, the builder
  attests it, a gate refuses changes without an audited record, and independent auditors check the
  record against the work, with audit depth set by how hard a change is to undo.
type: software
